<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Qualcomm shares climb.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Qualcomm shares climb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Qualcomm Inc rose slightly on Thursday, up 3/8 to 39-1/2, in after-hours activity, traders said.</p>
<p>The company said it has signed a license agreement with Hitachi Ltd for wireless infrastructure equipment based on Qualcomm's code division multiple access (CDMA) IS-95 technology.</p>
<p>Apart from Qualcomm, trade was quiet after hours, dealers said.</p>
